%% State machine for a report and its moderation action (FR-MOD, FR-AI)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Open: user files report
  Open --> Scored: AI suggestion stored
  Open --> Unscored: LLM timeout / invalid output
  Scored --> Dismissed: moderator dismisses
  Unscored --> Dismissed: moderator dismisses
  Scored --> Actioned: hide / remove / notice / mute
  Unscored --> Actioned: hide / remove / notice / mute
  Actioned --> Appealed: author appeals (once, within 7 days)
  Actioned --> Final: 7 days pass with no appeal
  Appealed --> Upheld: different moderator confirms
  Appealed --> Overturned: different moderator reverses
  Overturned --> [*]: content restored / mute lifted
  Upheld --> Final
  Dismissed --> [*]
  Final --> [*]: removed content purged after 30 days
